title: Posts & Telegraphs
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: posts_policy_timer += 2; week_actions += 1
view-if: posts_policy_timer == 0 and posts_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
tags: sovnarkom, government
card-image: img/posts.PNG

The <b>People's Commissariat for Posts & Telegraphs</b> (Narkompochtel) is charged with administration of communications and the postal service. 
  
= Posts & Telegrams

- @administration
- @postal
- @telecommunications
- @newspapers
- @posts_null
- @root: Do not change communications policy
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@posts_null
title: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: posts

@posts_return
title: Cancel action.
go-to: posts

  
@administration
title: ADMINISTRATION

- @improve_admin
- @hire_staff
- @corruption
- @posts_return

@improve_admin
title: Streamline the commissariat
subtitle: Cut waste and inefficiencies, increase labor intensity
choose-if: posts_corruption = 0
unavailable-subtitle: There's nothing more to cut at the moment. 
on-arrival: posts_expend -= 0.25; efficacy_posts += 0.1 if efficacy_posts < 1; posts_streamline += 8; 

@hire_staff
title: Hire administrative personnel
subtitle: -0.5 resources
on-arrival: efficacy_posts += 0.2 if efficacy_posts < 1; posts_expend += 0.25; resources -= 0.5;

@corruption
title: Root-out departmental corruption. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
on-arrival: efficacy_posts += 0.1 if efficacy_posts < 1; resources -= 0.5;


@postal
title: POSTAL SERVICE

- #postal_options
- @posts_return

@build_postal_service
title: Build up postal infrastructure in remote districts. 
subtitle: -1 resources – Offices will be built and overhauled. 
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – [?if resources < 1: We lack the resources. ?]
tags: postal_options
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1; Q.posts_expend += 0.25; Q.monopolies += 0.02; 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 5;
  Q.peasants_b += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.kulaks_b += 1*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.instability -= 0.25; 
!}

@stamps
title: Issue new line of stamps. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources – This should raise revenue over time. 
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – [?if resources < 0.5: We lack the resources. ?]
tags: postal_options
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; 
  Q.monopolies += 0.015; 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 3; Q.workers_unrest -= 1; 
!}

@monitor_correspondence
title: Establish monitoring for counterrevolutionary correspondence. 
subtitle: -1 resources – Letter and telegram traffic will be monitored by dedicated agents. 
choose-if: resources >= 1 and efficacy_posts >= 0.8
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – [?if resources < 1: We lack the resources. ?][?if efficacy_posts < 0.8 : We lack the administrative capacity. ?]
tags: postal_options
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1; Q.posts_expend -= 0.5; 
  Q.instability -= 1; Q.democraticity -= 1; Q.disillusionment += 2;
  Q.b_strength += 1; 
!}




@telecommunications
title: TELECOMMUNICATIONS

- #telecommunications_options
- @posts_return

@build_telegrams
title: Build up and repair telegraph infrastructure. 
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – [?if resources < 1: We lack the resources. ?]
tags: telecommunications_options
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1; Q.posts_expend += 0.25;
  Q.efficacy_posts += 0.05; 
  Q.instability -= 0.5; Q.b_strength += 0.5;
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 2; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 2; Q.workers_unrest -= 2; 
  Q.morale += 0.05; 
!}

@found_radio
title: Establish a radio communications network. 
subtitle: -2 resources — This has the potential to transform the way we reach the mases. 
choose-if: resources >= 2 and efficacy_posts >= 0.8
unavailable-subtitle: -2 resources – [?if resources < 2: We lack the resources. ?][?if efficacy_posts < 0.8 : We lack the administrative capacity. ?]
tags: telecommunications_options
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.radio = 1
  Q.resources -= 2; Q.posts_expend += 0.5;
  Q.instability += -2; Q.b_strength += 2;
  Q.peasants_b += 8*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.kulaks_b += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.workers_b += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 3; Q.workers_unrest -= 3; 
!}

@expand_radio
title: Build up the radio network and invest in radio production. 
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: radio >= 1
choose-if: resources >= 2 and efficacy_posts >= 0.8
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – [?if resources < 1: We lack the resources. ?][?if efficacy_posts < 0.8 : We lack the administrative capacity. ?]
tags: telecommunications_options
on-arrival: {!
  Q.radio += 1; 
  Q.resources -= 1; Q.posts_expend += 0.25;
  Q.instability += -1; Q.b_strength += 1;
  Q.peasants_b += 6*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.kulaks_b += 4*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.workers_b += 4*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 3; Q.workers_unrest -= 3; 
!}




  
@newspapers
title: NEWSPAPERS

- #newspaper_options
- @posts_return


@crackdown_newspapers
title: Crack down on hostile newspapers and hinder their distribution. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
choose-if: resources >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: [?if resources < 0.5: -0.5 resources – We lack the funds. ?]
tags: newspaper_options
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; 
  Q.instability -= 1; Q.democraticity -= 1; Q.b_strength += 0.5;
!}

@reading_rooms
title: Invest in rural reading rooms to boost literacy and outreach. 
subtitle: -1 resources
tags: newspaper_options
choose-if: resources > 1 and efficacy_posts >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: -1 resources – [?if resouces < 1 : We lack the resources. ?] [?if efficacy_posts < 0.7 : We lack the administrative capacity. ?]
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1; Q.posts_expend += 0.25; 
  Q.peasants_b += 5*(1-Q.b_dissent); Q.kulaks_b += 3*(1-Q.b_dissent); 
  Q.peasants_unrest -= 5; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 5;
  Q.b_strength += 0.5; 
!}




